;
; Two exports and no more. `DllRegisterServer` is deliberately absent: a
; system effect that can register itself is one any stray `regsvr32` can
; attach to somebody's speakers, and the installer helper is where that
; decision is made and undone.
;
; PRIVATE keeps them out of the import library, which nothing links against —
; Windows finds these by name through the loader, never at link time.

EXPORTS
    DllGetClassObject   PRIVATE
    DllCanUnloadNow     PRIVATE
